            "review_text": "Trần R\n11 contributions\n0\nAmazing bar ever\nMay 2023 • Family\nAmazing view, excellent drinks with happy hour from 4pm. It's on a beautiful pool, I love this bar so much!!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 13, 2023\nMKT\nDear tr_nr2023,\n\nThank you for visiting our Blue Bar and for taking the time to write this kind review. It is wonderful and heartwarming to know that you had a memorable experience. Your words will be the good motivation for us to deliver the highest standards of service. Located on the rooftop at the five-star Potique hotel Nha Trang, our Blue Bar is one the best bars to relax and watch the sunset over the sea from above in the heart of Nha Trang.\n\nOnce again, thanks for your review and we would be honored to welcome you back in the future for another relaxing.\n\nWarmest regards,\nBlue Bar Nha Trang\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
